  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5500 SEXUAL OFFENDER OR OFFENDER AGAINST CHILDREN REGISTRATION UNDER LENS SYSTEM",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Saf-C 5500 SEXUAL OFFENDER OR OFFENDER AGAINST CHILDREN REGISTRATION UNDER LENS SYSTEM\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 651-B:7, IV; RSA 651-B:8\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #6358, effective 10-22-96 replaced existing rules Saf-C 1200 entitled \"Sexual Offender Registration\" under LENS System and were authorized by RSA 632-A:18. 1996 NH Laws 292 repealed RSA 632-A:11-19. RSA Chapter 651-B (1996 NH Laws 292) requires registration by sexual offenders and offenders against children and provides a new rulemaking authority, RSA 651-B:8",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5500.html"
